",\"is not yet available in this build\",\"could not read claude code config\",\"permission-prompt-tool not found\",\"MCP tool not found\",\"is registered from an untrusted source\",\"reserved marketplace name\",\"references ${user_config\",\"user_config in a shell-form command\",\"monitor commands cannot safely reference\",\"CLAUDE_PLUGIN_OPTION\",\"would be spawned with zero tools\",\"subagent_type is required\",\"the general-purpose agent is not available in this session\",\"file is covered by a read deny rule\",\"this write left the memory index\",\"over its read limit\",\"can't open mcp settings while no terminal is attached\",\"can't open mcp settings in a background session\",\"this session has no saved transcript\",\"it was stopped before its first response finished\",\"this session was running agent\",\"which is no longer available\",\"tool restrictions no longer apply\",\"re-create the agent\",\"CLAUDE_CODE_PROCESS_WRAPPER\",\"must exec, not daemonize\",\"couldn't reach the background service\",\"request too large\",\"accumulated images and attachments\",\"cannot make it fit\",\"this conversation cannot continue as is\",\"request too large for the api's 32mb request limit\",\"automatic compaction failed\",\"input contained only whitespace\",\"blank prompt\",\"only whitespace, so nothing was sent to the model\",\"EUNKNOWN\",\"uv_spawn\",\"uv_cwd\",\"the current directory no longer exists\",\"it was deleted or moved\",\"start claude code from an existing directory\",\"can't read the current directory\",\"socket is closed\",\"settings file exceeds the 2mib limit\",\"cannot use settings file\",\"workspace not trusted\",\"home-directory trust is never saved\",\"pkill: refusing to run\",\"pattern matches the claude cli process\",\"restored the code, but skipped\",\"skipped files were left untouched\",\"diff is too large for ultrareview\",\"too large for ultrareview\",\"pass a closer base branch\",\"could not find merge-base\",\"shares no history with HEAD\",\"yo